#reason src/renderer/assets/icons/chevron-down.svg Icon for the dropdown halves of the review header's split pills
#reason src/renderer/assets/icons/comment.svg Icon for the Comment pill in the review header
#reason src/renderer/assets/icons/copy.svg Icon for the Copy all pill in the review header
#reason src/renderer/assets/icons/unfold.svg Icon for the button that shows or collapses unchanged lines
#reason src/renderer/lib/copymenu.ts Gives file rows a standard popover menu that opens where the user right-clicked
#reason src/renderer/lib/keycaps.ts Gives tooltips, the command palette and the comment box one shared way to draw keyboard keys
#reason test/helpers/pr-rows.ts Opens a changed file the way users now do, row then File or Diff, so tests stop clicking removed buttons
#reason test/lantern-pr-file-stats.test.ts Checks the per-file line counts against a real git repository and rejects bad input
#reason test/lantern-pr-rows.test.ts Checks the new row markup, the remembered File or Diff choice and the copy menu
#reason src/main/lantern-host-drivers.ts Takes the record URL to provider lookup from shared code so the renderer can use it too
#reason src/main/lantern-prdiff.ts Computes per-file added and removed line counts with one git numstat, so the sidebar and header show them before any diff is read
#reason src/main/main.ts Answers the renderer's request for a pull request's per-file line counts
#reason src/preload/workspace.ts Exposes the per-file line count request to the renderer
#reason src/renderer/command-palette.css Drops the palette's own key chip style in favour of the shared one
#reason src/renderer/command-palette/index.ts Draws command keys with the shared key chips
#reason src/renderer/features/lantern.ts Reads a pull request's line counts through the preload, and sends Previous and Next file to the project on screen
#reason src/renderer/floating.css Styles the shared key chips once for every place that shows keys
#reason src/renderer/global.d.ts Types the per-file line count call the preload now exposes
#reason src/renderer/lantern-prs.css Styles changed file rows like the PR list selection, with counts and pills right-aligned
#reason src/renderer/lantern-review.css Lays out the new review header, split pills and the comment box as a popover over the code
#reason src/renderer/lantern-select.css Stops file rows from selecting text, since right-click now opens a copy menu
#reason src/renderer/lantern.css Gives the reason a teal block with its label above, and styles the fold icon and the copy menu
#reason src/renderer/lib/comments/box.ts Makes the comment field the main part of the box, offers quick texts for the chosen intent, and shows the save keys as chips
#reason src/renderer/lib/comments/tools.ts Turns Comment and Copy all into split pills with icons, matching the redesigned review header
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternmacroside.ts Follows the file row helper losing its step number
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternprpanel.ts Makes each changed file one click target with its reason and counts, and labels the PR link View PR with the host logo
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternreview.ts Shows name, folder and counts in the header, keeps an open reason when counts arrive, and steps files with Left and Right
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternview.ts Loads line counts once per PR, adds a copy menu on right-click, and steps files with arrows on the rows without stealing scrolling
#reason src/renderer/lib/modalsteps.ts Lets the review pane step one file back or forward without wrapping at the ends
#reason src/renderer/lib/prdiffmodal.ts Replaces the fold text button with an icon and drops the PR number the new header no longer shows
#reason src/renderer/tooltip/index.ts Draws command keys with the shared key chips
#reason src/renderer/workspace.ts Registers Previous and Next file once, so with two projects open they never step the hidden one
#reason src/shared/commands/keymap.ts Names the Enter key so a shortcut that uses it reads as a key chip on every platform
#reason src/shared/commands/nodes.ts Registers previous and next file so the arrow keys and other callers step files through one command
#reason src/shared/lang/de/fix-requests.json Translates the new Explain and Question quick texts
#reason src/shared/lang/en/fix-requests.json Adds quick texts for the Explain and Question intents
#reason src/shared/lang/es/fix-requests.json Translates the new Explain and Question quick texts
#reason src/shared/lang/fix-requests.ts Ties every quick text to one intent so the comment box offers only the texts of the chosen intent
#reason src/shared/lang/fr/fix-requests.json Translates the new Explain and Question quick texts
#reason src/shared/lang/it/fix-requests.json Translates the new Explain and Question quick texts
#reason src/shared/lang/pl/fix-requests.json Translates the new Explain and Question quick texts
#reason src/shared/lang/pt/fix-requests.json Translates the new Explain and Question quick texts
#reason src/shared/lang/uk/fix-requests.json Translates the new Explain and Question quick texts
#reason src/shared/providers.ts Holds the record URL to provider lookup so the View PR link can show the host's logo
